<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - COLUMBIA LAB STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - COLUMBIA LAB STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it initiated coverage of Columbia Laboratories Inc as a buy, market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Columbia Lab lost 1/16 to 18-13/16.</p>
</text>
